        <item>
            <title>3.22.1</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:41:49 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>222</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.22.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 3.22.1</h2><ul></ul><p><strong>Improved</strong></p><ul><li>Custom AI Blocks are less likely to make up a value when a file has none.</li><li>Ollama and LM Studio keep the finished title and description when a long reply is cut off.</li><li>Folder sorting with Ollama or LM Studio asks the model again about files it left unsorted.</li></ul><p><strong>Fixed</strong></p><ul><li>The template picker no longer grows past the screen with many templates and keeps the selected template in view.</li><li>When Zush AI is briefly unavailable, files are retried instead of asking you to check a provider account.</li></ul>
]]></description>
